3942a4ea0f56e98a0e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":18,"visitor":42598703,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-21T15:23:00.070Z","creator":{"name":"Shoot the Murderer","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":16625338474,"name":"Infinite Craft AI","desc":"» The Roblox remake of Infinite Craft (neal.fun) and Little Alchemy—a multiplayer crafting game powered by AI!\n» Start with 💧 Water, 🌎 Earth, 🌬️ Wind and 🔥 Fire. Combine, merge, and craft elements to discover millions of new creations!\n\n- Discover unlimited element combinations with AI\n- Compete on global leaderboards\n- Craft with friends in multiplayer mode\n- Unlock badges and rare discoveries\n\n🚀 PRIORITY QUEUE GAMEPASS 🚀\n➛ Skip the queue with priority processing\n➛ Craft two element pairs at once\n\n👑 GROUP BENEFITS 👑\n➛ Exclusive rewards (join Strongest Roblox Players)\n\n📊 GAME INFO 📊\n» 25M+ elements discovered by the community\n» Both exploiting and creating inappropriate elements will result in a ban\n» Disclaimer: Infinite Craft AI do not have the same recipes as neal.fun's Infinite Craft.","path":"/game/16625338474-infinite-craft-ai","slug":"16625338474-infinite-craft-ai","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/130fcf341853250b263e4aa2a7218b3f9d496b785aa7e795631078e51a79bbc8.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bfffade87f0e081f7a8d5720ee3db033/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":18,"visitor":10357385,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-15T05:12:02.110Z","creator":{"name":"Strongest Roblox Players","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":88626889628925,"name":"[Nightmare] Pocong: Cursed Hospital [Scary Horror]","desc":"PvP Mode Added!\n\nA restless soul, the \"Pocong,\" wanders the halls of an abandoned hospital. As an investigator, uncover the truth, collect lost belongings, and perform the ritual to lay the spirit to rest.\n\nWill you soothe the soul, or become the hospital’s next target...?\n\n📝 HOW TO PLAY:\n\n🔍 INVESTIGATE: Search for items required for the ritual.\n🏃 SURVIVE: Run and hide from the Pocong roaming the corridors!\n🕯️ RITUAL: Return items to the desk to awaken the spirit's memories.\n🚪 ESCAPE: Complete all 4 stages to break the curse.\n\n⚠️ WARNING: This game contains intense jumpscares, flashing lights, and loud noises. Play at your own risk. Headphones recommended for the best experience.\n\n🌸I'm a solo indie developer from Japan. Thank you so much for playing and supporting my game! If you enjoy the game, please support me by leaving a 👍 Like and ⭐ Favorite!\n\nTags: Horror, Scary, Pocong, Ghost, Multiplayer, Jumpscare, Indonesia, Survival, PvP","path":"/game/88626889628925-pocong-cursed-hospital","slug":"88626889628925-pocong-cursed-hospital","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9ceafa0028763d9b07532c438ea9696610b5c1974df20ab0dc54d2f34e5467d0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6340270930abc9f862736e454d8d4d1f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":18,"visitor":68729185,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-02T07:10:51.706Z","creator":{"name":"POCONG Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":15800296330,"name":"FREE | 🏀 RB World 5 ","desc":"Welcome to RB World 5, a semi-realistic basketball simulation!\n\n- 🏀 Play with friends in Quick Play with preset & created players!\n- 🏀 Create your own player!\n- 🏀 Play competitively against other players in PvP!\n- 🏀 Conquer the world of basketball against AI teams!\n- 🏀 Customize your very own personal gym!\n- 🏀 Start or join a league!\n\n- Exploiting, cheating, or sabotaging games could get you a temporary or permanent ban.","path":"/game/15800296330-rb-world-5","slug":"15800296330-rb-world-5","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/24d2e01bcfc141cab04d9b57d8dbd2aa18c11e17e8c56f4fc8b58ec24255add1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-29193ff9824e2156be8c6dcb281d6286/150/150/Image/Png/noFilt